          "key": "request_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Scope and authority boundary",
          "guidance": "Use references and status fields rather than copying tax identifiers, bank details, identity documents, credentials, or confidential contracts into this general form. A listed document is not a legal or professional validation. Follow applicable purchasing, access, privacy, security, and retention policy and route specialist judgments to the authorized reviewer."
        }
